# Literary source and text structure
#
# Where every claim points back to. Line ids like SIL-16-0145.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m01_source> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Literary source and text structure" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crm:E73_Information_Object

iy:Work a owl:Class .
iy:Epic a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Work .
iy:Kandam a owl:Class .
iy:Canto a owl:Class .
iy:Line a owl:Class .
iy:Commentary a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Work .

iy:partOfWork a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:inCanto a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:lineText a owl:ObjectProperty .
